WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.965
The scorer (left) lets the referee's tablet (right) in: "Menu" → "Connect tablets".

2
00:00:05.015 --> 00:00:07.593
1 "How tablets connect": "Internet" works wherever the tablets are online.

3
00:00:07.643 --> 00:00:10.397
No internet in the hall? "Hall Wi-Fi" or "Wi-Fi from this computer" need the desktop app.

4
00:00:10.447 --> 00:00:14.288
2 "Which tablet": turn on "Referee".

5
00:00:14.338 --> 00:00:16.757
3 "Scan, then enter the PIN": the QR code and the PIN for the tablet.

6
00:00:16.807 --> 00:00:22.915
The tablet opens the referee page: type the PIN, then "Enter".

7
00:00:22.965 --> 00:00:27.501
Connected: the tablet shows the court. Then "Done".

8
00:00:27.551 --> 00:00:34.551
Every rally on the scoresheet shows on the referee tablet at once.
